{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39147","headline":"宿泊孟津寄三堂友人 · 韦庄","name":"宿泊孟津寄三堂友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解缆西征未有期，槐花又逼桂花时。\n鸿胪陌上归耕晚，金马门前献赋迟。\n只恐愁苗生两鬓，不堪离恨入双眉。\n分明昨夜南池梦，还把渔竿咏楚词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}